flowchart TD
    IN[Public JSONL messages] --> STATE[SurveyState]
    STATE --> PLAN[Planner: geometry and exposure]
    STATE -. Optional public context .-> LLM[LLMClient: budgets and retries]
    LLM --> CHECK[Validate model advice]
    CHECK --> PLAN
    LLM -. Optional redacted events .-> AUDIT[Audit sink]
    PLAN --> VALIDATE[Validate action]
    VALIDATE --> OUT[JSONL decision response]
    PLAN -. Exception .-> FALLBACK[Wait fallback]
    VALIDATE -. Rejected .-> FALLBACK
    FALLBACK --> OUT
